msgid "Mobile VR"
msgstr "Mobile VR"

msgid ""
"Godot has a mobile VR implementation that is meant to be used with phones "
"placed inside of a VR holder. It is implemented through "
"the :ref:`MobileVRInterface <class_mobilevrinterface>`. This is a bare bones "
"implementation that outputs a side by side stereoscopic image. It supports "
"basic 3DOF tracking on phones that provide gyroscope and accelerometer data."
msgstr ""
"Godot 提供了行動平台 VR 實作方案，適用於將手機置於 VR 支架中的場景。該方案通"
"過 :ref:`MobileVRInterface <class_mobilevrinterface>` 實作；這是一款基礎版實"
"作，可輸出並排立體影像。對於支援陀螺儀和加速度計資料的手機，該方案支援基礎的 "
"3DOF 追蹤功能。"

msgid ""
"This implementation is not actively maintained. As it allows maintainers and "
"reviewers the ability to test stereoscopic rendering without the need for "
"expensive XR hardware, this XR interface is mostly used for diagnostic "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"本實作項目未得到積極維護。由於該XR介面允許維護人員和評審人員在無需昂貴XR硬體"
"的情況下測試立體渲染效果，因此該XR介面主要用於診斷目的。"

msgid ""
"The mobile VR interface has various settings that control the output "
"provided to screen. The most important two are the ``k1`` and ``k2`` "
"constants that affect the amount of barrel distortion that is applied to "
"counter the lens distortion of the VR phone holder used. Many have a QR code "
"you can scan that provides this information."
msgstr ""
"移動VR界麵包含多種用於控制螢幕顯示內容的設定項，其中最重要的兩項是 ``k1`` 和 "
"``k2`` 常數——它們決定了所施加的桶形畸變程度，用於抵消所用VR手機支架造成的鏡頭"
"畸變。許多裝置上均設有可掃描的二維碼，掃描後即可取得相關參數資訊。"

msgid ""
"It is also important to provide the correct dimensions of the device and the "
"phone's display, these metrics are stored in centimeters."
msgstr ""
"此外，提供裝置及手機顯示屏的正確尺寸也至關重要；這些尺寸均以釐米為單位儲存。"
